{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1526136-conspiracy-questions-and-sharing","id":1526136,"title":"Conspiracy Questions and Sharing","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Deviant: The Renegades"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-11-29T15:17:22-08:00","id":1526136,"title":"Conspiracy Questions and Sharing","content":"So, making a conspiracy isn't easy. I thought I'd make a topic dedicated to sharing ideas of conspiracies, some of the ones you've designed, ideas for one, and most importantly; questions or &quot;i'm stuck on X&quot; problems.<br /> <br /> It can cover just about anything: node ideas, icon ideas, linchpin questions and thoughts, etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28143-firestar001","name":"firestar001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-29T15:30:52-08:00","id":1526138,"title":"","content":"One thing I'm struggling a little with is the idea of &quot;funding&quot; the conspiracy, especially as a node. Where does the money get moved from? And what would be the linchpin for such a node?<br /> One thought would be: Banks and Donors. But what would the linchpin be for such a thing? The account? The person with the account login?<br /> <br /> Or am I overthinking it? My current conspiracy is a government black site project, off the books. \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28143-firestar001","name":"firestar001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-29T15:31:41-08:00","id":1526139,"title":"","content":"The key idea is, what space do they fill. Some conspiracies are total foes. Others are more ambiguous. Since conspiracies create Deviants, they have to have a strong motivation. Are they trying to create supersoldiers? Why? Are they an arms dealer looking for the ultimate product? Are they a Cult looking to smite the godless? Are they subtle revolutionaries determined to liberate humanity by making human to powerful to control?<br /> <br /> This is a very limited set of possibilities. But they would answer a lot about the background. Try this idea. Maybe the whole conspiracy is a dupe to a powerful being from outside of our reality. That would lead in wild new directions.<br /> <br /> <br /> Once you know the conspiracy's role in the game and its goals everything else falls into place.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":857,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","user":"Astromancer","date":". 12-02-2023, 06:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-29T18:54:21-08:00","id":1526149,"title":"","content":"Conspiracies don't have to be expensive, they can be a group of people with a forbidden tome and some black candles who pay for their hobby of making Deviants by working at Walmart. Hell, Walmart itself could be the Conspiracy with the Walden family seeking to create the perfect employee. <br /> <br /> I will admit though I like tying my Deviants to other supernaturals, so that's an option to, maybe an Ordo dracul experiment does succeed in removing the curse of vampirism but it leaves the person as something else, and the Ordo is the conspiracy. <br /> <br /> Desperate people can make for an interesting one, as can those who prey upon them. Imagine a conspiracy that goes to rich people on their death beds and offers them another chance at life as a Deviant, but in exchange they have to turn over all their worldly goods to the conspiracy. <br /> <br /> The military and secret organizations are a bit cliche, but they work. <br /> <br /> Hunters can literally work for conspiracies, so any of them can work, but it doesn't necessarily have to be evil and dark either. Imagine a hunter conspiracy dedicated to opposing slashers, but instead of killing them they use a mix of arcana, psychotherapy, and drugs to bring them back from slasherhood to Deviants.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-29T20:17:06-08:00","id":1526150,"title":"","content":"How about one dedicated to unlocking the full potential of the human mind via psychic powers.<br /> <br /> Telepathy, telekinesis, apportation, body thieves, they employ and study all of them. The objective is to create a cutting edge gene therapy to allow any human to gain these abilities.<br /> <br /> Funding comes from the Cheiron group, apparently they found an entrance to a Lower Depth with no Matter, so since the denizens try to eat any technology carried, mental abilities are a reliable way to conduct operations and retrieve samples for autopsies.\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-29T20:21:46-08:00","id":1526151,"title":"","content":"Psychic projections are the only safe way to explore - the body is matter, after all","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-29T21:40:56-08:00","id":1526153,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1526136-conspiracy-questions-and-sharing?p=1526150#post1526150\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How about one dedicated to unlocking the full potential of the human mind via psychic powers.<br /> <br /> Telepathy, telekinesis, apportation, body thieves, they employ and study all of them. The objective is to create a cutting edge gene therapy to allow any human to gain these abilities.\u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>I really like this idea but I think I would go darker with it even, make it a eugenics experiment across the ages conducted by a body thief who wants to perfect human psychic potential, but that may be a better villain for a Mummy or Vampire game. Or... Dark Eras WWII Deviant....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-29T22:04:25-08:00","id":1526156,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowcatX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1526136-conspiracy-questions-and-sharing?p=1526153#post1526153\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I really like this idea but I think I would go darker with it even, make it a eugenics experiment across the ages conducted by a body thief who wants to perfect human psychic potential, but that may be a better villain for a Mummy or Vampire game. Or... Dark Eras WWII Deviant....</div> </div> </div> </div>Definitely, there is a lot of potential for the employees to have personal stakes. A body thief you sees all these &quot;whipper snappers&quot; having cool powers and wants a way to tap into more abilities.<br /> <br /> A psychic vampire that is unable to keep up with the Essence demands of his eternal youth and wants a solution, like becoming a body thief or finding a way to perfect their power.<br /> <br /> A mage who wants to make humanity evolve beyond being prey of the supernatural, researching psychics so they can create a mindflayer based Legacy, ushering humanity into the next level. <br /> <br /> Cheiron probably does worry too much, so long as their expertise is available and they are showing results.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-30T01:16:58-08:00","id":1526167,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowcatX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1526136-conspiracy-questions-and-sharing?p=1526153#post1526153\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I really like this idea but I think I would go darker with it even, make it a eugenics experiment across the ages conducted by a body thief who wants to perfect human psychic potential, but that may be a better villain for a Mummy or Vampire game. Or... Dark Eras WWII Deviant....</div> </div> </div> </div>A Body Thief could easily have been active in WWII or the Thirty Years War or the Social Wars (ancient Rome). Since they can freely change their race and sex (although I assume most folks have preferences) they can manipulate an impressively wide group of people.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-30T04:16:00-08:00","id":1526174,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1526136-conspiracy-questions-and-sharing?p=1526167#post1526167\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A Body Thief could easily have been active in WWII or the Thirty Years War or the Social Wars (ancient Rome). Since they can freely change their race and sex (although I assume most folks have preferences) they can manipulate an impressively wide group of people.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can totally imagine a ring of Demons being like \u201cThis is the SAME PERSON. They\u2019re a demon, but they are so good at their cover that not even WE have found them.\u201d The Twist is: they're a body thief and the 'embeds' are the Variations<br /> <br /> Plus there\u2019s an idea of Infrastructure causing Divergence, so there\u2019s THAT wrench thrown into the mix.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28143,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28143-firestar001","user":"firestar001","date":". 11-30-2023, 07:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28143-firestar001","name":"firestar001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-30T06:34:19-08:00","id":1526183,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1526136-conspiracy-questions-and-sharing?p=1526167#post1526167\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A Body Thief could easily have been active in WWII or the Thirty Years War or the Social Wars (ancient Rome). Since they can freely change their race and sex (although I assume most folks have preferences) they can manipulate an impressively wide group of people.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's why I suggested immortal PCs (ie. kindred or mummies) as opposed to Deviants for that particular game, you could have multiple clashes over a span of time and slowly come to the realization that the person you fought a thousand years ago (or whatever) is the same person you're fighting today, just in a different body.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-30T16:27:47-08:00","id":1526194,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1526136-conspiracy-questions-and-sharing?p=1526139#post1526139\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The key idea is, what space do they fill. Some conspiracies are total foes. Others are more ambiguous. Since conspiracies create Deviants, they have to have a strong motivation. ... Are they a Cult looking to smite the goddess?</div> </div> </div> </div>There's one Demon game I'm running for a friend that involves them being an ex-goddess that got kicked out by the God-Machine. So you just gave me an interesting idea of &quot;What if there was also a cult that misinterpreted some text and thinks said ex-goddess is EVIL? Now we gotta deal with Angels AND Deviants.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1526136-conspiracy-questions-and-sharing?p=1526139#post1526139\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is a very limited set of possibilities. But they would answer a lot about the background. Try this idea. Maybe the whole conspiracy is a dupe to a powerful being from outside of our reality. That would lead in wild new directions.<br /> Once you know the conspiracy's role in the game and its goals everything else falls into place.</div> </div> </div> </div>Usually my (currently 3) conspiracies are always the antagonists and I mostly know what I want to do with them. It's just the NODES and LINCHPINS and ICONS parts that I'm having trouble coming up with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28143-firestar001","name":"firestar001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-01T20:43:55-08:00","id":1526221,"title":"","content":"Speaking of immortals. A Standing 1 Conspiracy can create an Agent Icon with a \u25cf Scar-free Variation (Devoted Companion page 25 &amp; 26). Thus, with \u25cf Anomalous Biology &lt;Ageless&gt; offering &quot;downside-free&quot; immortality, the incentive to attain and maintain membership in a Conspiracy is frighteningly high.<br /> <br /> Something to consider is what grey market and antagonistic niches are available in the campaign. <br /> <br /> Examples:<br /> 1) an organization that will erase all electronic/digital evidence (cctv, government records, metadata from going online, etc.) of a character for a month after the character provides a functional human kidney in trade<br /> 2) a strange individual who will provide a safe house to your troupe, but instead of asking for money wants to swap bodies (\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf Body Snatcher &lt;Body Swap&gt;) with each member of the troupe for 1 hour per day in the safe house <br /> 3) a group of Deviant mercenaries that is willing to work bono, but after each pro bono job they require a member of their clients to kill a target of the mercenaries choosing if they are to continue working with them<br /> 4) a black market that also services a conviction touchstone","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28213-raw_brewer_devoted","name":"RAW_brewer_devoted","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28213_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-14T10:11:34-08:00","id":1530828,"title":"","content":"I'm working on a Renegade who merged with a void spirit named One Who Names Nothing, and trying to flesh out the conspiracy chasing him. (Ray is essentially an anomalous spirit-claimed, functioning as a Coactive Deviant) They're called the Order of the Abacus, and are lead by mathematicians, fringe physicists, and numerologists seeking to understand and solve a &quot;Divine Equation.&quot; They are currently hunting Ray, believing his rare void spirit might provide them with supernatural insights into zero, the empty set, and other mathematical concepts associated with emptiness or lack. This circle of scholars and mystics would serve as the Hierarchical node at the center, but I'm having difficulty coming up with ideas for the other nodes that actually get stuff done. Any ideas?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10118-bronzedog","name":"BronzeDog","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"239"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-14T12:49:01-08:00","id":1530836,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BronzeDog</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1526136-conspiracy-questions-and-sharing?p=1530828#post1530828\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm working on a Renegade who merged with a void spirit named One Who Names Nothing, and trying to flesh out the conspiracy chasing him. (Ray is essentially an anomalous spirit-claimed, functioning as a Coactive Deviant) They're called the Order of the Abacus, and are lead by mathematicians, fringe physicists, and numerologists seeking to understand and solve a &quot;Divine Equation.&quot; They are currently hunting Ray, believing his rare void spirit might provide them with supernatural insights into zero, the empty set, and other mathematical concepts associated with emptiness or lack. This circle of scholars and mystics would serve as the Hierarchical node at the center, but I'm having difficulty coming up with ideas for the other nodes that actually get stuff done. Any ideas?</div> </div> </div> </div>What do they need to solve the Divine Equation, how much progress have they made already, and why is the particular lacuna that they believe Ray can help with either a roadblock or a shortcut worth pursuing?<br /> <br /> More prosaically, what is the Standing of the Order?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-14T13:44:18-08:00","id":1530845,"title":"","content":"Ray has the Psycho-Onomastics Variation and a void spirit, so I'm thinking something like they want to find the true name of &quot;zero&quot; to put in the equation. I'm leaning towards having them as the &quot;global but diffuse&quot; variation of Standing 3. They believe once they have the full equation and solve it, they'll ascend to a realm of pure mathematics, kind of mimicking the Exarchs from Mage. After the first post, Inspired by Anumerous, I've decided they're unwitting pawns of an Acamoth who wants to make a Paradox so deep so it can return to the Abyss through the resulting &quot;hole.&quot; (Basically, make a portal by forcing reality to divide by zero.) I'm still working out what else they need, but something involving the numbers of 1, e, i, pi, and infinity could be an angle to consider.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10118-bronzedog","name":"BronzeDog","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"239"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-14T17:19:30-08:00","id":1530853,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BronzeDog</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1526136-conspiracy-questions-and-sharing?p=1530845#post1530845\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ray has the Psycho-Onomastics Variation and a void spirit, so I'm thinking something like they want to find the true name of &quot;zero&quot; to put in the equation. I'm leaning towards having them as the &quot;global but diffuse&quot; variation of Standing 3. They believe once they have the full equation and solve it, they'll ascend to a realm of pure mathematics, kind of mimicking the Exarchs from Mage. After the first post, Inspired by Anumerous, I've decided they're unwitting pawns of an Acamoth who wants to make a Paradox so deep so it can return to the Abyss through the resulting &quot;hole.&quot; (Basically, make a portal by forcing reality to divide by zero.) I'm still working out what else they need, but something involving the numbers of 1, e, i, pi, and infinity could be an angle to consider.</div> </div> </div> </div>Alright, so from this, you figure out what the overall shape of their plans and pursuits are toward that goal (including what they were doing before Ray came onto their radar, if they didn't have any hand in his genesis or vice versa) and what they need to carry out those pursuits. Funding is usually a solid angle, but it's also almost categorically represented as a Structural Node that will be less effective for conspiracy actions.<br /> <br /> Some basic conceptual things to address:<br /> <br /> 1. What is stopping the Order from finding the other elements of the equation? Would brute-forcing the necessary calculations require more man-hours than humanly possible without a supercomputer? Is some form of supernatural insight necessary to route the math right? Is a computational device with specific supernatural qualities needed? Have they stumbled across any of their own forms of Divergence in the course of trying to figure them out?<br /> <br /> 2. Once they have all the pieces they need for the equation, what is necessary to &quot;solve&quot; it in a way that produces the intended outcome? Things in the Chronicles of Darkness often rely on concrete phenomena, so does the solution need to be voiced aloud, written in blood, demonstrated in more esoteric symbolic terms? Does mere comprehension lead a person to collapse in on themselves as a person-scale void, which the rest of the conspiracy wouldn't want without being able to communicate with the newly &quot;ascended&quot; individual and Anumerus presumably wouldn't want because it needs a bigger hole in the world for its purposes?<br /> <br /> 3. Given they're now the catspaws of an Abyssal being, if they succeed at their goal (or fail in the wrong way), what are the possible consequences for the wider world, as representable in Deviant's systems through the rules of &quot;a Project that acquires the required amount of Effort completes at the end of the next chapter, but can be stopped by the cohort&quot;?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-15T10:29:46-08:00","id":1530911,"title":"","content":"Thanks for all the questions and help. It's giving me angles to approach this big thing.<br /> <br /> 1. I'm thinking the equation is something along the lines of a classic math problem: It can't be brute forced by a computer and needs some true understanding of the concepts behind the numbers, lateral thinking, and so forth. There were a lot of mathematicians trying to crack the code for centuries, but global collaboration has spurred on a lot of progress in recent years, plunging many into a religious zeal over what had been an idle pursuit. Once they figure out the complete equation, then an extraordinary computer might be able to plug in all the variables and chug out the numbers. As for Divergence they've deliberately caused, I suppose they might have a few Cephalids who developed powers by holding parts of the equation in their head, and maybe some Invasives where they experimented with brain implants to enhance someone's calculation abilities.<br /> <br /> 2. I'm thinking the final step would involve programming the complete equation into a quantum computer, plugging in the variables, and letting quantum mechanics determine the answer. The Order mistakenly believes that doing so will elevate anyone who reads the answer will let them ascend into a realm of math and symbols, free to play with the fundamentals of their own little realities. The being leading them along is an Acamoth (possibly related to Anumerus, but distinct) looking to use the gaping hole in reality it forms to return to the Abyss. While it's been trying to do it by corrupting enough Mages, it's been cultivating this option with Sleepers.<br /> <br /> 3. I'm thinking success would open a hole the Acamoth desires and a Gulmoth or two would take the opportunity to invade through it. The Order's leaders would get sucked in along with it, joining the Acamoth's nightmarish realm of Paradox-ridden math. The complexity of the equation is high enough that a cohort could set back the Project by destroying the records of its pieces. The entire leadership across the world will also need to gather to collaborate on the programming and view the result. Removing a few Linchpin members could destroy previously made progress.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10118-bronzedog","name":"BronzeDog","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"239"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-28T06:14:28-08:00","id":1531679,"title":"","content":"Heh heh. Sounds like they need a superNATURAL supercomputer. Be something like it operates in 1s, 0s and <b>2s.</b> Trap a few tech or calculator spirits in the more-literal magic box.<br /> <br /> (this is just me spouting random nonsense)<br /> I can also imagine the God-Machine playing a minor part in it (or having a cameo in it).<br /> <br /> Or even the Order is trying to solve the equation, but Demons interfering with occult matrices keep changing the equation. Ex: Final equation is A+3*C. A being like, some year that such was discovered, C being the number of matrices or infrastructure in town.<br /> The order only has A+3*? So they go about counting the matrices, and in between the final report and count, the demons destroy a matrix. So the order still thinks it\u2019s A+3*C, when it\u2019s now A+3*(C-1).<br /> <br /> the hilarious part: the Demons don\u2019t know the Order exists and vice-versa. <br /> <br /> apologies for the off-topic jokes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28143-firestar001","name":"firestar001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}